Exit codes are right: zero, one, and two.

185
00:05:18,556 --> 00:05:21,948
Results go to standard out, and problems go to standard error.

186
00:05:22,498 --> 00:05:25,314
You use argparse, and every call has a timeout.

187
00:05:25,864 --> 00:05:28,253
No traceback, and never a bare except.

